        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Darnley Grove is a new residential development of 85 A-rated homes at Townparks, Athboy, Co. Meath. Named after the Earls of Darnley who shaped this historic town, the development combines modern energy-efficient design with the charm of one of Meath’s most welcoming communities.\r\n\r\nOffering 2, 3, and 4-bedroom homes – plus on-site crèche facilities and generous public open spaces – Darnley Grove is designed for families, first-time buyers, and anyone seeking quality living with effortless connections to Dublin."
